Bug 2007529 - Continue building the mail context menu after command state errors. r=mkmelin

Treat a failed command-state query as disabled so tag rebuilding and
separator normalization can still complete. This matches the existing
error handling of goUpdateCommand (globalOverlay.js), which the main
menubar uses to update its commands one by one.

Add regression coverage for a failing cmd_markThreadAsRead query.

Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D320928


